    "title": "City officials respond to reports of meeting law violations, residents speak up - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By DAKOTA OSWALT ,\n2 days ago Amid the chaos of a potential data center coming to Nodaway County, The Maryville Forum reported on the Maryville City Council’s closed meeting regarding the project. Since then, The Forum also reported on numerous closed-door meetings held by Council in the past couple of years. Missouri Press Association attorney Dan Curry told The Forum that most of them should not have been closed. Read full article",
